cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "IPF Transcriptomic Framework (ipffx)"
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
authors:
  - family-names: "Prasanth"
    given-names: "DSNBK"
    email: "dsnbkprasanth@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "School of Pharmacy & Technology Management, SVKM's NMIMS, Hyderabad, India"
abstract: >
  Reproducible cross-cohort and broad-compartment-resolved transcriptomic
  framework for idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis: bulk DE concordance,
  composition-adjusted DESeq2, donor-level pseudobulk module scoring, focused
  ligand-receptor prioritisation, external bulk and single-nucleus
  corroboration, and LINCS safety-aware transcriptomic-reversal
  hypothesis generation.
keywords:
  - idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis
  - transcriptomics
  - DESeq2
  - CIBERSORT
  - LIANA
  - LINCS
  - drug repositioning
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dsnbkprasanth/ipf_framework"
